### API Testing Suite for New Backend Features
### Use with REST Client extension in VS Code or Postman

### CONFIGURATION
@baseUrl = http://localhost
@courseServicePort = 4002
@ideServicePort = 4003
@analyticsServicePort = 4006
@authToken = Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@testUserId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@testCourseId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@testSubmissionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003

################################################################################
# 1. PEER CODE REVIEW SYSTEM API TESTS
################################################################################

### 1.1 Create Review Rubric
POST {{baseUrl}}:{{courseServicePort}}/api/peer-review/rubrics
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{authToken}}

{
  "courseId": "{{testCourseId}}",
  "name": "Python Code Review Rubric",
  "description": "Rubric for reviewing Python assignments",
  "minReviewsRequired": 2,
  "allowSelfReview": false,
  "anonymizeReviewers": true,
  "anonymizeCodeAuthors": false,
  "reviewDeadline": "2026-04-18T23:59:59Z",
  "runMossCheck": true,
  "mossSimilarityThreshold": 0.75
}

### 1.2 Get Course Rubrics
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{courseServicePort}}/api/peer-review/courses/{{testCourseId}}/rubrics
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 1.3 Create Rubric Criterion
POST {{baseUrl}}:{{courseServicePort}}/api/peer-review/rubrics/RUBRIC_ID_HERE/criteria
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Code Quality",
  "description": "Assess the overall quality and readability of the code",
  "displayOrder": 1,
  "weight": 1.5,
  "maxScore": 5,
  "scoreLabels": {
    "1": "Poor - Hard to read, no structure",
    "2": "Fair - Some organization",
    "3": "Good - Clear structure",
    "4": "Very Good - Well organized",
    "5": "Excellent - Professional quality"
  },
  "examples": "Use meaningful variable names, proper indentation, comments where needed",
  "isRequired": true
}

### 1.4 Get Rubric Criteria
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{courseServicePort}}/api/peer-review/rubrics/RUBRIC_ID_HERE/criteria
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 1.5 Assign Reviewers (Round-Robin Algorithm)
POST {{baseUrl}}:{{courseServicePort}}/api/peer-review/rubrics/RUBRIC_ID_HERE/assign
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{authToken}}

{
  "submissionIds": [
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003"
  ],
  "reviewsPerSubmission": 2,
  "algorithm": "round-robin"
}

### 1.6 Get Reviewer Assignments
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{courseServicePort}}/api/peer-review/reviewers/{{testUserId}}/assignments?status=pending
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 1.7 Start Review
POST {{baseUrl}}:{{courseServicePort}}/api/peer-review/reviews/REVIEW_ID_HERE/start
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 1.8 Submit Criterion Score
POST {{baseUrl}}:{{courseServicePort}}/api/peer-review/reviews/REVIEW_ID_HERE/scores
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{authToken}}

{
  "criterionId": "CRITERION_ID_HERE",
  "score": 4,
  "feedback": "Good code structure, but could use more comments"
}

### 1.9 Add Line Comment
POST {{baseUrl}}:{{courseServicePort}}/api/peer-review/reviews/REVIEW_ID_HERE/comments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{authToken}}

{
  "fileName": "main.py",
  "lineNumber": 42,
  "lineEndNumber": 45,
  "codeSnippet": "def calculate_total(items):\n    return sum(items)",
  "comment": "Consider adding type hints and docstring",
  "commentType": "suggestion",
  "severity": "low"
}

### 1.10 Get Review Comments
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{courseServicePort}}/api/peer-review/reviews/REVIEW_ID_HERE/comments
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 1.11 Submit Review
POST {{baseUrl}}:{{courseServicePort}}/api/peer-review/reviews/REVIEW_ID_HERE/submit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{authToken}}

{
  "overallFeedback": "Good work overall. The code is functional and mostly well-structured. Consider adding more documentation.",
  "timeSpentSeconds": 1200
}

### 1.12 Get Submission Reviews
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{courseServicePort}}/api/peer-review/submissions/{{testSubmissionId}}/reviews
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 1.13 Rate Review Helpfulness
POST {{baseUrl}}:{{courseServicePort}}/api/peer-review/reviews/REVIEW_ID_HERE/rate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{authToken}}

{
  "isHelpful": true
}

### 1.14 Get Reviewer Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{courseServicePort}}/api/peer-review/reviewers/{{testUserId}}/stats
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 1.15 Create Dispute
POST {{baseUrl}}:{{courseServicePort}}/api/peer-review/reviews/REVIEW_ID_HERE/dispute
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{authToken}}

{
  "authorId": "{{testUserId}}",
  "reviewerId": "REVIEWER_ID_HERE",
  "reason": "Unfair scoring",
  "description": "The reviewer marked me down for not using type hints, but the assignment didn't require them",
  "requestedOutcome": "score_adjustment"
}

### 1.16 Get Disputes (Instructor)
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{courseServicePort}}/api/peer-review/disputes?status=open
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 1.17 Resolve Dispute
POST {{baseUrl}}:{{courseServicePort}}/api/peer-review/disputes/DISPUTE_ID_HERE/resolve
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{authToken}}

{
  "resolvedBy": "INSTRUCTOR_ID_HERE",
  "resolution": "After review, the score is justified as type hints were covered in the lesson material",
  "resolutionAction": "no_change"
}

### 1.18 Get Pending Reviews
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{courseServicePort}}/api/peer-review/pending-reviews?reviewerId={{testUserId}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 1.19 Get Submissions Awaiting Reviews
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{courseServicePort}}/api/peer-review/awaiting-reviews?authorId={{testUserId}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 1.20 Get High-Quality Reviewers
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{courseServicePort}}/api/peer-review/high-quality-reviewers?limit=10
Authorization: {{authToken}}

################################################################################
# 2. LEARNING HEALTH DASHBOARD API TESTS
################################################################################

### 2.1 Get User Health Score
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{analyticsServicePort}}/api/learning-health/users/{{testUserId}}/courses/{{testCourseId}}/health-score
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 2.2 Get Component Breakdown
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{analyticsServicePort}}/api/learning-health/users/{{testUserId}}/courses/{{testCourseId}}/component-breakdown
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 2.3 Get At-Risk Learners (All)
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{analyticsServicePort}}/api/learning-health/courses/{{testCourseId}}/at-risk-learners
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 2.4 Get Critical At-Risk Learners
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{analyticsServicePort}}/api/learning-health/courses/{{testCourseId}}/at-risk-learners?riskLevel=critical
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 2.5 Generate Instructor Nudge
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{analyticsServicePort}}/api/learning-health/users/{{testUserId}}/courses/{{testCourseId}}/instructor-nudge
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 2.6 Get Dashboard Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{analyticsServicePort}}/api/learning-health/courses/{{testCourseId}}/dashboard-summary
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 2.7 Update Health Score (Single User)
POST {{baseUrl}}:{{analyticsServicePort}}/api/learning-health/users/{{testUserId}}/courses/{{testCourseId}}/update-health-score
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 2.8 Batch Update Health Scores
POST {{baseUrl}}:{{analyticsServicePort}}/api/learning-health/courses/{{testCourseId}}/batch-update
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 2.9 Get Health Score Trends
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{analyticsServicePort}}/api/learning-health/users/{{testUserId}}/courses/{{testCourseId}}/trends?days=30
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 2.10 Get Intervention Recommendations
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{analyticsServicePort}}/api/learning-health/courses/{{testCourseId}}/interventions
Authorization: {{authToken}}

################################################################################
# 3. IDE CLIPBOARD & KEYSTROKE TRACKING API TESTS
################################################################################

### 3.1 Log Clipboard Attempt
POST {{baseUrl}}:{{ideServicePort}}/api/clipboard/log-attempt
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{authToken}}

{
  "userId": "{{testUserId}}",
  "sessionId": "SESSION_ID_HERE",
  "lessonId": "LESSON_ID_HERE",
  "assessmentId": "ASSESSMENT_ID_HERE",
  "attemptType": "paste",
  "source": "keyboard_shortcut",
  "blocked": true,
  "contentLength": 150,
  "detectedBy": "clipboard_api"
}

### 3.2 Get Session Clipboard Attempts
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{ideServicePort}}/api/clipboard/session/SESSION_ID_HERE
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 3.3 Get Assessment Clipboard Attempts
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{ideServicePort}}/api/clipboard/assessment/ASSESSMENT_ID_HERE?userId={{testUserId}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 3.4 Get User Clipboard Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{ideServicePort}}/api/clipboard/stats/{{testUserId}}?assessmentId=ASSESSMENT_ID_HERE
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 3.5 Start Keystroke Session
POST {{baseUrl}}:{{ideServicePort}}/api/keystroke/start-session
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{authToken}}

{
  "userId": "{{testUserId}}",
  "lessonId": "LESSON_ID_HERE",
  "assessmentId": "ASSESSMENT_ID_HERE",
  "problemId": "PROBLEM_ID_HERE"
}

### 3.6 Log Keystroke Events (Batch)
POST {{baseUrl}}:{{ideServicePort}}/api/keystroke/log-events
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{authToken}}

{
  "events": [
    {
      "sessionId": "SESSION_ID_HERE",
      "timestampMs": 1712880000000,
      "eventType": "keydown",
      "keyCode": 65,
      "keyName": "a",
      "isSpecialKey": false,
      "lineNumber": 10,
      "columnNumber": 5,
      "charInserted": "a"
    },
    {
      "sessionId": "SESSION_ID_HERE",
      "timestampMs": 1712880000100,
      "eventType": "keydown",
      "keyCode": 8,
      "keyName": "Backspace",
      "isSpecialKey": true,
      "lineNumber": 10,
      "columnNumber": 6,
      "charsDeleted": "a"
    }
  ]
}

### 3.7 End Keystroke Session
POST {{baseUrl}}:{{ideServicePort}}/api/keystroke/end-session/SESSION_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{authToken}}

{
  "finalCode": "def hello():\n    print('Hello World')",
  "language": "python",
  "avgTypingSpeedWPM": 45,
  "avgKeyIntervalMs": 150,
  "consistencyScore": 85
}

### 3.8 Get Keystroke Session
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{ideServicePort}}/api/keystroke/session/SESSION_ID_HERE
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 3.9 Get Keystroke Events (For Replay)
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{ideServicePort}}/api/keystroke/events/SESSION_ID_HERE?limit=10000
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 3.10 Get User Typing Patterns
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{ideServicePort}}/api/keystroke/patterns/{{testUserId}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 3.11 Get Sessions with Integrity Concerns
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{ideServicePort}}/api/keystroke/integrity-concerns?userId={{testUserId}}&assessmentId=ASSESSMENT_ID_HERE
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 3.12 Get Typing Pattern Deviations
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{ideServicePort}}/api/keystroke/pattern-deviations?userId={{testUserId}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 3.13 Flag Session for Integrity Review
POST {{baseUrl}}:{{ideServicePort}}/api/keystroke/flag-session
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{authToken}}

{
  "userId": "{{testUserId}}",
  "sessionId": "SESSION_ID_HERE",
  "assessmentId": "ASSESSMENT_ID_HERE",
  "flagType": "typing_burst",
  "severity": "high",
  "description": "Detected 50+ keystrokes in less than 1 second, indicating possible paste",
  "evidence": {
    "burstDuration": 850,
    "keystrokeCount": 52,
    "avgIntervalMs": 16
  }
}

### 3.14 Get Integrity Flags
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{ideServicePort}}/api/keystroke/integrity-flags?userId={{testUserId}}&severity=high&reviewed=false
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 3.15 Review Integrity Flag
POST {{baseUrl}}:{{ideServicePort}}/api/keystroke/review-flag/FLAG_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{authToken}}

{
  "reviewedBy": "INSTRUCTOR_ID_HERE",
  "reviewNotes": "Reviewed keystroke replay - appears to be legitimate fast typing, not paste",
  "actionTaken": "no_action"
}

################################################################################
# 4. HEALTH CHECKS
################################################################################

### 4.1 Course Service Health
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{courseServicePort}}/health

### 4.2 IDE Service Health
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{ideServicePort}}/health

### 4.3 Analytics Service Health
GET {{baseUrl}}:{{analyticsServicePort}}/health
